# CityParking Gate SDK — API Reference

Base URL: `https://<your-server>/api`

All endpoints (except login) require the `Authorization: Bearer <token>` header.

All responses use the `ApiResponse<T>` wrapper:

```json
{
  "success": true|false,
  "message": "Human-readable message",
  "data": { ... },
  "timestamp": "2026-07-04T08:30:00"
}
```

---

## 1. Device Login

Authenticate the Raspberry Pi and receive a JWT token.

### Request

| Field | Value |
|-------|-------|
| **Method** | `POST` |
| **URL** | `/api/auth/login` |
| **Content-Type** | `application/json` |
| **Authentication** | None (public endpoint) |

### Body

```json
{
  "email": "gate-device@cityparking.edu",
  "password": "device-password"
}
```

### Success Response — `200 OK`

```json
{
  "success": true,
  "message": "Login successful",
  "data": {
    "token": "eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9.eyJzdWIiOiJnYXRlLWRldmljZUBjaXR5cGFya2luZy5lZHUiLCJpYXQiOjE3MjAwMDAwMDAsImV4cCI6MTcyMDA4NjQwMH0.signature",
    "type": "Bearer",
    "id": 15,
    "email": "gate-device@cityparking.edu",
    "firstName": "Gate",
    "lastName": "Device",
    "role": "USER"
  },
  "timestamp": "2026-07-04T08:00:00"
}
```

### Failure Responses

**401 Unauthorized — Invalid credentials:**

```json
{
  "success": false,
  "message": "Invalid email or password",
  "data": null,
  "timestamp": "2026-07-04T08:00:00"
}
```

### Timeout Recommendation

| Parameter | Value |
|-----------|-------|
| Connect timeout | 10 seconds |
| Read timeout | 15 seconds |

### curl Example

```bash
curl -X POST https://cityparking-api.onrender.com/api/auth/login \
  -H "Content-Type: application/json" \
  -d '{"email":"gate-device@cityparking.edu","password":"device-password"}'
```

