## Recommended Future APIs

The following endpoints do not currently exist but are recommended
for future Raspberry Pi integration:

| Endpoint | Method | Purpose |
|----------|--------|---------|
| `/api/gate/health` | `GET` | Pi health check ping (no auth) |
| `/api/gate/config` | `GET` | Remote config pull (relay duration, thresholds) |
| `/api/gate/logs` | `POST` | Batch upload local access logs |
| `/api/gate/heartbeat` | `POST` | Periodic device status report |
| `/api/gate/alerts` | `POST` | Report hardware faults (camera, relay) |

**These endpoints are NOT implemented.** They are listed here as
recommendations for future development.